{#- The Ambry seal, for any florist: a fine double ring like a pressed stamp, the outer ring in this week's colour, the
    house's initial in the serif inside, a single stem through the ring at the foot. Set `sealClass` first. -#}
<svg class="mt-seal {{ sealClass }}" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="mt-seal-o" cx="24" cy="24" r="22.6"/><circle class="mt-seal-i" cx="24" cy="24" r="19.4"/><text class="mt-seal-l" x="24" y="30.6" text-anchor="middle">{{ site.business.name | initial }}</text><path class="mt-seal-s" d="M24 43.4v-5.6M24 40.4c-1.6-.3-2.6-1.2-2.9-2.6M24 39.4c1.4-.2 2.3-1 2.6-2.2"/></svg>
